      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Petit Sac Noir mini bucket bag made its debut on the Prada Fall/Winter 2025 runway. Crafted from lightweight, soft recycled nylon, the compact bucket silhouette is accented with architectural curved leather handles. A gold chain strap and a silver metal ball pendant add a playful touch to the minimalist design.",
