    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Noir mini bucket bag first appeared on the Prada Fall/Winter 2025 women's runway. This season's collection, themed \"Raw Glamour,\" sees co-creative directors Miuccia Prada and Raf Simons embarking on a philosophical exploration of \"What defines contemporary femininity?\"",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "grid",
      "text": null,
