          "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/14o7xee/3d15ced737614d26.jpg",
          "price": ""
        },
        {
          "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/14o7xee/adc2f338750cd8c3.jpg",
          "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/14o7xee/2a91cfde1efb976d.jpg",
          "price": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "caption",
      "text": "PRADA Fall/Winter 2025 Women's Show",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The bucket bag's petite silhouette is paired with a chunky chain and metal ball pendant, creating a striking contrast of soft and hard elements that perfectly encapsulates the theme of femininity.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/14o7xee/4ee4bd7dade8eccc.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/14o7xee/5bdc3c34b03bab31.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· Re-Nylon and Padding Technique ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The bag is crafted from Re-Nylon, a regenerated nylon fabric, and padded to achieve a plush, voluminous shape.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
