    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "As a signature material for Prada, nylon is a powerful symbol of the brand's core identity. Prada Re-Nylon is made from recycled and purified ocean plastic waste, fishing nets, landfill-bound fabrics, and textile fiber waste. Through depolymerization and purification, these materials are transformed into new polymers and yarn. This regenerated nylon yarn can be recycled infinitely, significantly reducing the impact on global warming.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/14o7xee/4525eb56874b1190.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/14o7xee/7a65a7b4bc2cb05b.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Beyond its sustainable and eco-friendly credentials, nylon fabric is also lightweight, durable, and water-resistant.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
