      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The bucket bag features a flat, spacious round base, offering ample capacity for its size. Even the mini version can accommodate thicker items like a cushion compact, a bifold wallet, or a mini water bottle.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "grid",
      "text": null,
