          "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/14o7xee/002a1fadfad628ec.jpg",
          "price": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "We managed to fit an iPhone, powder compact, wallet, card case, perfume, keys, and lipstick inside. The nylon body is nearly weightless, making it incredibly portable. The chain and metal ball pendant add a touch of refined playfulness to any look.",
