    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "PRADA is an Italian luxury fashion house founded in 1913 by Mario & Martino Prada in Milan, Italy. Initially specializing in handbags, travel trunks, and accessories, the brand has since expanded into ready-to-wear, footwear, fragrances, and more. PRADA also owns Miu Miu, Church’s, and Car Shoe. Since 1913 from Milan.",
